        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyuuth kɛ dep thëm",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ Jɛn min cä waŋdä kap nhial, cua̱ wut mi te tetdɛ kɛ dep thëm nɛn! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua̱ thiec i̱, “Kä wi̱i̱nikä?” Kä cuɛ ɣä loc i̱, “Wa̱a̱ thɛm ni Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kɛ ɣöö bä di̱tdɛ kɛnɛ bärɛ ŋa̱c.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jääk Kuɔth in ruac kɛ ɣä ben, kä cu jääk dɔ̱diɛn mi bä jɛ ben lor ben, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Riŋni kä ŋuɛ̈t ɛ mi, jio̱k ni jɛ i̱, ‘Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm ba wec mi ba ciɛŋ a thil päny, kɛ ɣöö tëë kɛ nɛy ti ŋuan kɛ ɣɔ̱k ti nyin ŋuan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɣän puɔ̱nydä ba̱a̱ päny maac mi wil jɛ, kä ba̱a̱ gɔɔydiɛn rɛydɛ,’ ruac ni ɣän Kuoth Nhial.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cio̱l pɛ̈ɛ̈cni jɔk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial wee i̱, “Biakɛ! Biakɛ! Barɛ rɔ̱ muun kuec caam, kɛ ɣöö cä yɛ däkä tuɔ̱ŋni ɣɔaa da̱ŋ ŋuaan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bia barɛ rɔ̱ yɛn pɛ̈ɛ̈c tin cieŋ kä Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn, lënyɛ rɔ̱ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛ jɛn min laar Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa ɛ, kɛ kɔr kä min cɛ ɣä jäk kä döör tin ca yɛ pɛc, kɛ ɣöö ramɔ ci yɛ nyɔt ɔ cɛ thiap ni ti̱ey waŋdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɣän bäkɛ thiap nikɛ tetdä, kä bi kɛna pɛ̈ɛ̈c nɛɛni tëë la̱tkɛ kɛ ikä. Kä bia cu ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö jäk ɣä Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial wee i̱, “Rɔali kä a lɔcdu tɛth ji̱n nya Dha-yɔn, kɛ ɣöö ɣän a bëëni, kä bä ben cieŋ rɛydun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ, bi döör ti ŋuan ben kä Kuoth Nhial, kä bi kɛna nɛɛkɛ. Kä bɛ cieŋ rɛydun, kä bia cu ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö ɛ jɛn jäk ɣä kä yɛ mɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi Kuoth Nhial Juda ka̱n ala wecdɛ mi rɛl rɔ, kä bɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm cu nyɔk kɛ mi mɛɛkɛ jɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä pa̱lɛ rɔ̱ piny nhiam Kuɔth Nhial yɛn nɛy diaal, kɛ ɣöö jɛn a bëëni guäth cieŋädɛ min rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
